      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear you're feeling this way, but it's important to listen to your body. While anxiety can cause a variety of symptoms, the chest heaviness and arm numbness you're experiencing could potentially be a more serious condition like a heart attack or pulmonary embolism, especially if the symptoms feel severe or persist. It's crucial to seek immediate medical attention to rule out any potentially dangerous conditions, even if they seem minor. Your well-being is a top priority.",
