      "content": "I understand that you're feeling overwhelmed and may feel it's just a panic attack, but the symptoms you're describing are concerning and not normal body sensations. It's essential to prioritize your health, and I'd strongly advise against waiting to see if these symptoms pass, especially as they persisted from last year and you mentioned taking anti-anxiety medication. We definitely don't want a potential heart issue to go untreated. Please consider using an available phone to reach family or friends, or even contact a healthcare professional for a telehealth consultation, so you can express your concerns and get guidance on how to proceed safely. It's better to be cautious and take the necessary steps immediately rather than risking your health.",
